workbench-code-style-no-provider = No settings provider keeps a code style scheme here.
workbench-code-style-no-project = Open a project to use its code style scheme.
workbench-code-style-exists = { $path } exists already.
workbench-code-style-agent-outside = An agent may read and write a code style scheme only inside the project, and { $path } is not.
